[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9785.269, "timestamp": "02:43:05", "text": "更像是，嗯，我们将要做……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9788.83, "timestamp": "02:43:08", "text": "我无法说出我还没听过的那首歌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9790.309, "timestamp": "02:43:10", "text": "最终定稿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9793.91, "timestamp": "02:43:13", "text": "不过，这肯定很有趣，而且会更加多样化。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9795.87, "timestamp": "02:43:15", "text": "关于我自己，因为我不是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9799.67, "timestamp": "02:43:19", "text": "我几乎不会唱歌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9801.75, "timestamp": "02:43:21", "text": "是啊，唱歌的时候声音很难听，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9804.91, "timestamp": "02:43:24", "text": "请听听我的录音，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9808.349, "timestamp": "02:43:28", "text": "我不知道的直播，我还没来过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9812.07, "timestamp": "02:43:32", "text": "接受我那些声音里的东西，我们都会发现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9817.63, "timestamp": "02:43:37", "text": "我们的声音嘎吱作响，但总有一天会是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9822.269, "timestamp": "02:43:42", "text": "正确的流程越复杂，所需时间就越长。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9825.75, "timestamp": "02:43:45", "text": "这个过程……哦等等，这个……呃……你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9826.71, "timestamp": "02:43:46", "text": "称呼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9829.87, "timestamp": "02:43:49", "text": "你知道，就是那首花火之歌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9833.63, "timestamp": "02:43:53", "text": "知道那首火歌，忘了B歌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9837.99, "timestamp": "02:43:57", "text": "是……呃……来自……"}]